    - rid: 2756910129984045057
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: Now, Mortal one
        text: Now, <pause=0.2>Mortal one,<pause=0.2> there is something you should
          know. Here in this space,  <pause=0.2>in this place<pause=0.2> are <blue>5
          items</blue>. They are connected to your wish.
        nextNodeID: You currently hold
    - rid: 2756910129984045058
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: You currently hold
        text: You currently hold already one of those, <blue>your Research Papers</blue>,
          that you lost on sea.
        nextNodeID: But beware
    - rid: 2756910129984045059
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: But beware
        text: But <shake><red>beware!</red></shake> Every being, <pause=0.2>every
          living, <pause=0.2>every breathing, living thing, <pause=0.2>all living
          have their path written.<pause=0.2> It has gotten you here,<pause=0.2>
          now you need to find your way in this place.
        choices:
        - choiceText: what are those items?
          nextNodeID: What are those items
        - choiceText: where should I go?
          nextNodeID: Where should I go
    - rid: 2756910129984045060
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: What are those items
        text: I cannot tell you, <pause=0.2>this is for you to find out on your own.
        nextNodeID: You need to go
    - rid: 2756910129984045062
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: You need to go
        text: You need to go on a journey to be able to find those items. Some may
          require different things from you, but they will be worthwhile to you,
          <pause=0.2>I am sure of that.
        choices:
        - choiceText: where should I go?
          nextNodeID: Where should I go
    - rid: 2756910129984045063
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: Where should I go
        text: In this world, there are different Islands. <pause=0.2>Island which
          you should visit and understand their meaning.
        nextNodeID: I implore you
    - rid: 2756910129984045064
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: I implore you
        text: I implore you <pause=0.2>to visit all the different Islands. Then at
          the <shake>end</shake> of your journey,<pause=0.2> across the island,<pause=0.2>
          <shake>something</shake> is awaiting you.
        nextNodeID: The Astrolabe
    - rid: 2756910129984045066
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: The Astrolabe
        text: The <green>Astrolabe</green> will help you on your journey. It will
          help you find your path on the starry sky.
        nextNodeID: 
    - rid: 6341597701268308045
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: Start second dialog
        text: This place <pause=0.2>between time and space ,<pause=0.2> is here to
          guide you to the place, <pause=0.2>where you need to go next. <pause=0.5>But
          only<pause=0.2> and only when you are ready for it.
        choices:
        - choiceText: about the path of Mortal
          nextNodeID: Path of Mortal
    - rid: 6341597701268308047
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: Path of Mortal
        text: Well, <pause=0.2>you see young one. The path of all Mortals is<pause=0.2>
          to walk towards their end<pause=0.2> and their new beginning.
        choices:
        - choiceText: but you are here to help me
          nextNodeID: But you are here to help me
    - rid: 6341597701268308048
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: But you are here to help me
        text: No, <pause=0.2>I am not here to help. I am to guide, <pause=0.2>on
          what lies before you.
        choices:
        - choiceText: then help me cheat death!
          nextNodeID: then help me cheat death!
        - choiceText: where should I go?
          nextNodeID: Where should I go
    - rid: 6341597701268308049
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: then help me cheat death!
        text: <shake>Oh?!</shake>
        nextNodeID: you dare
    - rid: 6341597701268308050
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: you dare
        text: You <shake>dare</shake> to <red>cheat</red> the order of all that has
          existed before time itself?
        nextNodeID: well, this is interesting
    - rid: 6341597701268308051
      type: {class: DialogueLineNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        nodeID: well, this is interesting
        text: Well, <pause=0.2>is this interesting. The <shake>other one</shake>
          figured, you would want to do that.
        nextNodeID: Now, Mortal one
